@startuml sample_sign_in_login_seq
title UC-sign-in - Sign in with email (Analysis Sequence)
' palette: boundary=blue · service=green · domain=amber · repo/port=lavender · infra=gray
' Step IDs are hand-placed: phase.step, e.g. 1.3. Reference in prose as sign-in 1.3

actor "Member" as U
participant "«boundary»\nSignInForm" as FORM #E6F0FB
participant "«service»\nAuthService" as AUTH #E7F4EA
participant "«repository»\nMemberRepository" as REPO #EEE7F7
participant "«root entity»\nMember" as MEMBER #FBF2D9
participant "«boundary»\nDashboard" as DASH #E6F0FB

== Phase 1 - Authenticate ==
U    -> FORM : 1.1 enter email + password, submit
FORM -> AUTH : 1.2 authenticate(email, password)
AUTH -> REPO : 1.3 getByEmail(email)
alt member found
  REPO --> AUTH : Member
  AUTH -> MEMBER : 1.4 verifyCredential(password)
  alt password matches
    MEMBER --> AUTH : true
  else password wrong
    MEMBER --> AUTH : false
    AUTH --> FORM : sign-in refused
  end
else no such member
  REPO --> AUTH : none
  AUTH --> FORM : sign-in refused
end

== Phase 2 - Reach the account ==
AUTH --> FORM : Member
FORM -> DASH : 2.1 show dashboard
DASH --> U : 2.2 dashboard shown
@enduml
